<ai-copilot wx:if="{{!submitting && (phase === 'intro' || phase === 'result')}}" page-key="simple-reaction" />
<ui-nav title="简单反应时" />
<view class="task-page theme-sunrise ai-copilot-safe-space"><view class="task-content">
  <view class="task-heading"><text class="task-kicker">处理速度与稳定性</text><text class="task-title">简单反应时测试</text><text class="task-subtitle">目标出现后尽快点击，等待时不要提前操作</text></view>
  <view class="task-card" wx:if="{{phase === 'intro' || phase === 'paused'}}"><text class="section-title">测试说明</text><text class="instruction">系统会在随机等待后显示蓝绿色目标。仅在目标出现后点击；提前点击和遗漏都会被记录。</text><view class="notice">轻量移动筛查版共 {{totalTrials}} 个正式试次。请将手机平放并使用同一只手完成；结果不可与完整临床工具直接等同。</view><text wx:if="{{phase === 'paused'}}" class="paused-text">本项已中断，需要从头重新开始</text><button class="primary-button" bindtap="startTest">{{phase === 'paused' ? '重新开始' : '开始测试'}}</button></view>
  <view class="task-card" wx:elif="{{phase === 'waiting' || phase === 'target'}}"><view class="progress-row"><text>第 {{currentTrial}} / {{totalTrials}} 次</text><text>{{progressPercent}}%</text></view><view class="progress-track"><view class="progress-value" style="{{'width:' + progressPercent + '%;'}}"></view></view><view class="stimulus-area reaction-stage {{phase === 'target' ? 'reaction-stage--target' : ''}}" aria-role="button" aria-label="{{phaseText}}" bindtap="handleTargetTap"><view class="reaction-target"></view><text class="reaction-label">{{phaseText}}</text></view></view>
  <view class="task-card" wx:elif="{{phase === 'result'}}"><text class="section-title">测试结果</text><view class="result-grid"><view class="result-stat"><text class="result-value">{{result.median_reaction_time_ms}} ms</text><text class="result-label">中位反应时</text></view><view class="result-stat"><text class="result-value">{{result.accuracy}}%</text><text class="result-label">有效反应率</text></view><view class="result-stat"><text class="result-value">{{result.false_starts}}</text><text class="result-label">提前点击</text></view><view class="result-stat"><text class="result-value">{{result.omissions}}</text><text class="result-label">遗漏</text></view></view><text class="sync-status">{{syncStatus}}</text><button wx:if="{{syncStatus === '待同步'}}" class="primary-button" bindtap="retrySync">重新同步</button><button wx:if="{{mode === 'battery'}}" class="secondary-button" bindtap="goNext">继续完整评估</button><button class="secondary-button" bindtap="startTest">重新测试</button></view>
  <text class="medical-tip">本测试仅记录客观反应指标，不替代专业医生诊断</text>
</view></view>
